bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    u8_array_into_word_array_residual_shapes_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 owner decision: keep the assignment slot firing on inferred word-array locals; fix the root instead: text.bytes() must be typed [u8] (byte data; crypto API already uses [u8]), after which the five `: [u8]` annotations become redundant."

